  "slug": "spicy-bloody-mary-mix",
  "name": "Spicy Bloody Mary Mix",
  "recipe_type": "breakfast",
  "brief_description": "With a nod to the famous \u2018bull shot\u2019 cocktail, this tasty bloody mary mix adds beef consomme for savory flavor. Drink it as is over ice or add vodka. Adjust the spices to your taste \u2014 this version is spicy!",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Mix the tomato juice, beef consomme, Worcestershire sauce, lemon juice, hot pepper sauce, celery salt, and black pepper together in a pitcher; chill."
    }
  ],
